sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant FD as Front Door<br>trade-imports-<br>ins-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
    end
    participant IDM as IDM

    Note over B,IDM: Steps 1 to 7 of the sign-in above.<br>The round trip is stored and expires after 10 minutes
    IDM-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/callback<br>?code=… or ?error=…, &state=…
    B->>RS: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>binding cookie if the browser holds one
    RS->>FD: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>binding cookie if the browser holds one
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins/{state}/completion<br>code or error, binding value
    alt No round trip for the state: expired, or already used
        SS-->>FD: 404 sign-in-unknown
    else Binding value missing or different
        Note over SS: Round trip consumed
        SS-->>FD: 422 sign-in-refused
    else IDM returned an error
        Note over SS: Round trip consumed
        SS-->>FD: 422 sign-in-refused
    else No approved role at the selected organisation
        Note over SS: Round trip<br>consumed,<br>binding value<br>checked
        SS->>IDM: POST IDM token endpoint<br>grant_type=authorization_code,<br>via CDP's outbound proxy
        IDM-->>SS: 200 id_token,<br>access_token, refresh_token
        Note over SS: ID token checked,<br>no approved role,<br>tokens discarded,<br>no record created
        SS-->>FD: 422 no-approved-role
    end
    Note over FD: No session<br>cookie set.<br>After 404 or<br>sign-in-refused,<br>sign-in again.<br>After no-<br>approved-role,<br>refusal page
